---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { rel, SUPPORT_EMAIL, LEGAL_NAME } from '../../consts';
const description = `Terms of Use and End User License Agreement for VibeRater by ${LEGAL_NAME}.`;
---
<Base title="Terms of Use · VibeRater" description={description} path="/terms/vibe-rater">
  <main class="page">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:720px;">
      <a class="back" href={rel('/apps/vibe-rater')}>← VibeRater</a>
      <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="updated">VibeRater · Last updated July 20, 2026</p>

      <p>
        These Terms of Use ("Terms") are the agreement (the "EULA") between you and {LEGAL_NAME}
        ("we," "us") for the VibeRater app and its social features (the "App"). By downloading or using
        the App, you agree to these Terms. If you do not agree, do not use the App.
      </p>

      <h2>Zero tolerance for objectionable content and abuse</h2>
      <p>
        There is <strong>no tolerance</strong> for objectionable content or abusive behavior on VibeRater.
        You agree not to post, share, or send content that is illegal, hateful, harassing, threatening,
        sexually explicit, violent, defamatory, or that targets, demeans, or endangers any person, and not
        to harass, impersonate, or abuse other users. Accounts that violate this policy may be removed
        without notice. We review reports of objectionable content and abusive users and act on them —
        typically within 24 hours — by removing content and, where warranted, ejecting the user who
        provided it.
      </p>

      <h2>Report and block</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Report:</strong> every post has a <em>Report</em> action. Flagged content is reviewed for safety and moderation, and removed if it violates these Terms.</li>
        <li><strong>Block:</strong> you can block any user from their profile. Blocking hides their content from you and prevents them from contacting you.</li>
        <li><strong>Contact us:</strong> you can also report concerns directly to <a href={`mailto:${SUPPORT_EMAIL}`}>{SUPPORT_EMAIL}</a>.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Eligibility</h2>
      <p>
        You must be at least 13 years old to use the App. If you are under the age of majority where you
        live, you may use the App only with the consent and supervision of a parent or legal guardian who
        agrees to these Terms.
      </p>

      <h2>For entertainment only</h2>
      <p>
        VibeRater is a novelty for fun. Its scores, grades, archetypes, auras, and other outputs are
        AI-generated entertainment — they are <strong>not</strong> a measurement of anything real about
        you, your appearance, your worth, or any person in a photo, and must not be relied on for any
        decision.
      </p>

      <h2>Your account</h2>
      <p>
        Some features (posting, friends, messages, events) use a profile that syncs to our service. You are
        responsible for activity on your account and for the content you choose to post, share, or save.
        Keep your device secure; access to your device may grant access to your account.
      </p>

      <h2>Your content</h2>
      <p>
        You keep ownership of the photos and content you create. To operate the social features, you grant
        us a limited, non-exclusive, worldwide, royalty-free license to host, store, reproduce, and display
        the content you choose to post or share, solely to provide and improve the App. Content you rate
        privately (without posting) is processed to generate your rating and is not published. You are
        responsible for having the rights to any content you upload, and for any people depicted in it.
      </p>

      <h2>Prohibited conduct</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Posting objectionable content as described above, or content you do not have the right to share.</li>
        <li>Harassing, threatening, impersonating, doxxing, or abusing other users.</li>
        <li>Uploading photos of other people without their consent, or content sexualizing minors (this is strictly forbidden and reported to authorities).</li>
        <li>Spamming, scraping, reverse-engineering, or attempting to disrupt or gain unauthorized access to the App or other accounts.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Suspension and termination</h2>
      <p>
        We may remove content, and suspend or terminate accounts, that violate these Terms — including
        removing an abusive user — with or without notice. You may stop using the App and delete your
        account at any time from within the App.
      </p>

      <h2>Advertising</h2>
      <p>
        The App may show ads served by Google AdMob. How your data is handled for ads, and your tracking
        choices, are described in our <a href={rel('/privacy/vibe-rater')}>Privacy Policy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Disclaimers and limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        The App is provided "as is," without warranties of any kind. To the fullest extent permitted by
        law, we are not liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use
        of the App or from content posted by other users. Nothing in these Terms limits liability that
        cannot be limited under applicable law.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        If these Terms change materially, the new version will be posted at this URL with an updated date
        above. Continued use of the App after a change constitutes acceptance.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions? Email <a href={`mailto:${SUPPORT_EMAIL}`}>{SUPPORT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
